{"data": [{"author_id": "3315697506", "created_at": "2026-10-24T14:13:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113997269041398175"], "id": "2113997269041398175", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 262, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2024年中国全年出生人口954万\n\n2025年中国全年出生人口792万\n\n以后学校还怎么搞哦！ \n\n大家觉得2026年还会下降吗？", "url": "https://x.com/soap628/status/2113997269041398175"}, {"author_id": "869544895538544640", "created_at": "2026-10-24T04:23:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113848796455006523"], "id": "2113848796455006523", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 11277, "like_count": 44, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "李强在国务院常务会议指出，要加快建设生育友好型社会，持续完善婚嫁、生育、养育、教育等政策，优化面向家庭的财税、社保、住房等支持举措，努力稳定新出生人口规模。\n\n稳定新出生人口规模，亡羊补牢，已经晚了！", "url": "https://x.com/dyw1968316/status/2113848796455006523"}, {"author_id": "1788870098457133056", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:39:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113626457339728254"], "id": "2113626457339728254", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 365, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "表态了！\n\n中国国常会：努力稳定新出生人口规模\n\n中国总理李强召开国务院常务会议，提出要持续积累和释放人口总和红利，优化面向家庭的社保和住房等举措，努力“稳定新出生人口规模”。", "url": "https://x.com/DangcingAI/status/2113626457339728254"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113999096969035776"]}, "author_id": "869544895538544640", "created_at": "2026-10-24T14:26:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114000523196088561"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/NR2yS4oXiH", "end": 164, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/dyw1968316/status/2114000523196088561/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113999096969035776", "start": 141, "url": "https://t.co/NR2yS4oXiH"}]}, "id": "2114000523196088561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 3643, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "31省份2025年人口出生率公布，全国出生人口达792万人，出生率为5.63‰，自然增长率为-2.41‰。只有7个省区人口正增长，分别是西藏、新疆、广东、宁夏、贵州、海南、青海，除了广东，都是边疆省份。\n人口自然增长率为负数，表明死亡人口大于出生人口。\n这才是中国人口的真正危机。 https://t.co/NR2yS4oXiH", "url": "https://x.com/dyw1968316/status/2114000523196088561"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113891723818549248"]}, "author_id": "1893880809821736960", "created_at": "2026-10-24T07:13:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113891726406332572"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 128, "start": 123, "tag": "生育政策"}, {"end": 132, "start": 129, "tag": "人口"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/SJ4ZnzJdMz", "end": 156, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GamePanda319135/status/2113891726406332572/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113891723818549248", "start": 133, "url": "https://t.co/SJ4ZnzJdMz"}]}, "id": "2113891726406332572", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "国务院常务会议提出，要加快建设生育友好型社会，优化面向家庭的财税、社保、住房等支持举措，努力稳定新出生人口规模。面对出生人口持续下降，政策进一步加码，覆盖婚嫁、生育、养育、教育全链条。专家建议提高育儿补贴、延长年限、按物价调整个税扣除等。👶📈\n\n#生育政策 #人口 https://t.co/SJ4ZnzJdMz", "url": "https://x.com/GamePanda319135/status/2113891726406332572"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113839585646284800"]}, "author_id": "1324566469", "created_at": "2026-10-24T13:23:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113984620199071982"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/wBOgf5mOop", "end": 40, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/mtans_sh/status/2113984620199071982/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113839585646284800", "start": 17, "url": "https://t.co/wBOgf5mOop"}]}, "id": "2113984620199071982", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 165, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "国常会：努力稳定新出生人口规模😄 https://t.co/wBOgf5mOop", "url": "https://x.com/mtans_sh/status/2113984620199071982"}, {"author_id": "1966924987425845250", "created_at": "2026-10-23T12:29:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113608829003043002"], "id": "2113608829003043002", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国国常会：努力稳定新出生人口规模", "url": "https://x.com/SlowLijiang/status/2113608829003043002"}, {"author_id": "2112068973969965056", "created_at": "2026-10-24T10:53:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113946892170379454"], "id": "2113946892170379454", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "全国每8个新生儿，就有1个出生在广东\n你猜你们省排第几，出生率是高还是低\n国家统计局《中国统计年鉴2026》刚公布了2025年31个省份的人口出生率\n2025年全国出生人口792万人，出生率5.63‰，自然增长率为负2.41‰\n有9个省份出生率超过7‰，分别是西藏、贵州、新疆、宁夏、青海、广东、海南、云南和广西", "url": "https://x.com/susan16808/status/2113946892170379454"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113841960888971264"]}, "author_id": "1260553941714186241", "created_at": "2026-10-24T13:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113986367072219353"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/L8yM7hbkaU", "end": 174, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2113986367072219353/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113841960888971264", "start": 151, "url": "https://t.co/L8yM7hbkaU"}, {"display_url": "x.com/whyyoutouzhele…", "end": 198, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/1905175803840942142", "start": 175, "url": "https://t.co/4MA4IP2k4Q"}]}, "id": "2113986367072219353", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 18, "impression_count": 31282, "like_count": 79, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 38, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "1905175803840942142", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "李强：努力稳定新生人口规模\n\n10月23日，中国总理李强主持国务院常务会议，提出要加快建设生育友好型社会，完善婚嫁、生育、养育、教育等政策，并优化财税、社保及住房等家庭支持举措，努力稳定新出生人口规模。\n\n2025年中国全年出生人口仅792万，较2024年的954万骤减162万，创数十年来最低水平。 https://t.co/L8yM7hbkaU https://t.co/4MA4IP2k4Q", "url": "https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2113986367072219353"}, {"author_id": "1961694254797029376", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:42:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113642164433608919"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "中国总理李强召开国务院常务会议，提出要持续积累和释放人口总和红利，优化面向家庭的社保和住房等举措，努力“稳定新出生人口规模”。", "display_url": "zaobao.com.sg/news/china/sto…", "end": 41, "expanded_url": "https://www.zaobao.com.sg/news/china/story20261023-9885891?utm_source=android-share&utm_medium=app", "images": [{"height": 500, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113642164916015104/vXicUPE3?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 909}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113642164916015104/vXicUPE3?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 18, "status": 200, "title": "中国国常会：努力稳定新出生人口规模", "unwound_url": "https://www.zaobao.com.sg/news/china/story20261023-9885891?utm_source=android-share&utm_medium=app", "url": "https://t.co/WiwxolW2Sh"}]}, "id": "2113642164433608919", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国国常会：努力稳定新出生人口规模\nhttps://t.co/WiwxolW2Sh", "url": "https://x.com/foo_sjsj/status/2113642164433608919"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113989752861151232"]}, "author_id": "1921437096688173056", "created_at": "2026-10-24T16:55:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114037955807649833"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/83GdFREU0L", "end": 165, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/4gU8m/status/2114037955807649833/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113989752861151232", "start": 142, "url": "https://t.co/83GdFREU0L"}]}, "id": "2114037955807649833", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 377, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "过去中国对内经济增长很大程度上依赖三大引擎：房地产、土地财政和地方基建。\n\n这三者有一个共同特征——通过 “信用扩张”，把未来的 “需求” 提前释放到当下。\n\n当人口红利、地产红利和出口红利逐步减弱后，旧增长模式创造的现金流已难以覆盖存量债务，于是系统开始越来越依赖借新债维持运转。 https://t.co/83GdFREU0L", "url": "https://x.com/4gU8m/status/2114037955807649833"}, {"author_id": "166476172", "created_at": "2026-10-24T07:21:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113893684844302357"], "id": "2113893684844302357", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 16683, "like_count": 53, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10月23日，李强主持国务院常务会议，提出优化面向家庭的社保、住房等支持政策，努力稳定出生人口规模。\n\n但中国养老金面临的现实是：领取养老金的人越来越多，缴费的劳动人口却在减少。\n\n几个关键数字：\n\n2020年，全国社会保险基金支出5.47万亿元；2025年增至7.74万亿元，五年增加2.27万亿元。", "url": "https://x.com/wongkim728/status/2113893684844302357"}, {"author_id": "2108441099714834432", "created_at": "2026-10-23T20:42:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113732814248214533"], "id": "2113732814248214533", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天国务院常务会议定了两件大事：统筹人口与经济社会发展、加力推进服务业扩能提质。\n· 人口：完善婚嫁生育养育教育政策，努力稳定新出生人口规模\n· 服务业：破解难点堵点，破除市场准入障碍，清理民间投资隐性壁垒", "url": "https://x.com/qiuqiu23126/status/2113732814248214533"}, {"author_id": "761100642282713089", "created_at": "2026-10-24T11:07:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113950424827150664"], "id": "2113950424827150664", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1236, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年全国结婚登记676.51万对，比上年增长10.8％。\n\n可明年是羊年啊，出生人口大概率还是创新低吧。", "url": "https://x.com/Wujizhuzhu/status/2113950424827150664"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113931376374448128"]}, "author_id": "1631837417790640128", "created_at": "2026-10-24T09:51:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113931025256706423", "2113931386449231898"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/aPNYKUQtbt", "end": 63, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/poorpela/status/2113931386449231898/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113931376374448128", "start": 40, "url": "https://t.co/aPNYKUQtbt"}]}, "id": "2113931386449231898", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 98, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "新目标是努力稳定出生人口\n\n既不是必须稳定，也不是努力增长\n\n说明这就不是个事 https://t.co/aPNYKUQtbt", "url": "https://x.com/poorpela/status/2113931386449231898"}, {"author_id": "2093708410902773760", "created_at": "2026-10-24T11:08:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113950842583965971"], "id": "2113950842583965971", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 250, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "全国都在为结婚率、生育率发愁。\n\n广东却在出生人口上持续领跑。\n\n同样是高房价、高压力，\n\n为什么广东还能生？", "url": "https://x.com/Beyond939/status/2113950842583965971"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113801962647179264"]}, "author_id": "2039794382472105984", "created_at": "2026-10-24T01:17:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113801972457656415"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/pmWE4C7kra", "end": 70, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/HaibingT48420/status/2113801972457656415/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113801962647179264", "start": 47, "url": "https://t.co/pmWE4C7kra"}]}, "id": "2113801972457656415", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 780, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "不懂就问 努力稳定出生人口 \n\n这他妈谁想出来的 怎么稳定\n\n意思要通知以后只能内射吗？？？ https://t.co/pmWE4C7kra", "url": "https://x.com/HaibingT48420/status/2113801972457656415"}, {"author_id": "2059833506729959429", "created_at": "2026-10-24T02:25:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113819140201038068"], "id": "2113819140201038068", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 244, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "现在国内出生人口数据差到开始发补贴了的地步了。\n\n一年3600，应该是想试水看韭菜们要上当了不。", "url": "https://x.com/Xqqc1w/status/2113819140201038068"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113807595966435328"]}, "author_id": "1134614241103581184", "created_at": "2026-10-24T01:39:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113807600055906404"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/St0baiQoTJ", "end": 77, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/huang3feng/status/2113807600055906404/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113807595966435328", "start": 54, "url": "https://t.co/St0baiQoTJ"}]}, "id": "2113807600055906404", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 870, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "他们又开始建设生育友好型社会了，\n\n要努力稳定新出生人口规模····\n\n看来，韭菜不生软肋的决策相当正确！ https://t.co/St0baiQoTJ", "url": "https://x.com/huang3feng/status/2113807600055906404"}, {"author_id": "1821498733248540672", "created_at": "2026-10-24T17:27:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114046025673650228"], "id": "2114046025673650228", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 57, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年中国全年出生人口仅792万，较\n\n2024年的954万骤减162万，创数十年来\n\n最低水平。这年头一般人谁还生小孩出\n\n来当牛做马。", "url": "https://x.com/qingwng51958911/status/2114046025673650228"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113840564609388544"]}, "author_id": "1865722200185307136", "created_at": "2026-10-24T03:50:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113840574063374624"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/oZLg3BFsb2", "end": 91, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/btcmos/status/2113840574063374624/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113840564609388544", "start": 68, "url": "https://t.co/oZLg3BFsb2"}]}, "id": "2113840574063374624", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 22019, "like_count": 139, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 51, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "国常会：努力稳定新出生人口规模 \n\n是稳定，\n可不是提升！\n\n说明上面对于一部分人选择不孕不育其实不care的，所以你也别想着要挟人家 https://t.co/oZLg3BFsb2", "url": "https://x.com/btcmos/status/2113840574063374624"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113622554871287808"]}, "author_id": "1491315935533096962", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:24:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113622570868289851"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/5ThQ90tqEV", "end": 78, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/hongsv11/status/211362257086